    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://www.neotomadb.org/>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/darwin1859-ch14-11--gpt--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
